      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-03-29T22:24:59.708Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And for my usual commentary…</p>\n<p>Fart jokes are funny and maturity is overrated.</p>\n<p>Oh yay, more about Tantrum! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I’m 40, and I would definitely be okay looking like Cable. &lt;.&lt;</p>\n<p>So that’s an interesting question, and I hope someone can come up with the list of mini-Nemeses we don’t have a lot of info on? I mean, Tantrum would have been first on my list at least, and we’ve got some info on all of them from the Nemeses episode, but what about the others? Who do we want to hear more about first?</p>\n<p>If they don’t call this guy Bloodhair, I will be very upset…</p>\n<p>Okay, Shredd’s pretty cool, upset redacted.</p>\n<p>Huh, Christopher’s missing a toe? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>This booping discussion is easily top five weirdest things to appear on this podcast, and that is saying something.</p>\n<p>“That’s not marry or the other thing!” Well said, Adam. XD</p>",
